  "timezone": "browser",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard \u2014 and which meter each panel reads",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Autonomous **Ralph loops** (`utilities/ralph_loop.sh`, Wiggum's `ralph_otel_ship.py`). Use the **task** variable to focus one loop.\n\n**Rebuilt 2026-08-27.** Every cost/token/tool/duration panel used to query Loki for `event=\"api_request\"`, `event=\"tool_use\"` and `event=\"gate\"`. Ralph has never written those as Loki *stream labels* \u2014 its Loki vocabulary is lifecycle only (`run_start`, `iter_start`, `phase_done`, `verification_passed|failed`, `reject`, `run_end`, \u2026). Those panels could not return data on any time range.\n\nThe usage numbers do exist, as real OTLP metrics scraped into **Prometheus** (`ralph_cost_usd_total`, `ralph_tokens_total`, `ralph_tool_use_total`, `ralph_iter_duration_ms`, `ralph_errors_total`), so the counters below now read Prometheus and the lifecycle panels read Loki. This also buys retention: Prometheus keeps 30d, Loki 7d.\n\nPer-request cost only lands on backends that report usage (`prime`). A `dsh`-backed run posts lifecycle events but no usage, so the Prometheus tiles legitimately read 0 for it.\n\n**On the `task` selector:** it is populated from Loki (`label_values({job=\"ralph\"}, task)`), so it lists the loops seen in the last 7 days. Prometheus keeps 30 days, so **All** (`.+`) shows Ralph history the selector cannot name \u2014 pick All for the long view. A task appears on both sides only once a usage-reporting backend runs it."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Runs",
      "description": "Loki lifecycle meter. `run_start` is a real Ralph event.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"ralph\", event=\"run_start\", task=~\"$task\"} [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
